{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"verdict\": \"both_partly\",\n  \"quotes\": [\n    \"In the 12 FOG‐OBS patients with PD, we recorded 99 trials where a FOG event occurred in the DOPAOFF condition (FOG‐OBS+ trials), with a median onset of 8 steps (interquartile range [IQR] = 6–11.5) after GI, and a total of 263 FOG episodes (Fig 1E–G).\",\n    \"These FOG‐OBS patients also completed 212 walking trials without FOG (FOG‐OBS− trials; see Fig 1E).\",\n    \"We first examined the relationship between LFP spectral power and GI RPC scores in trials without FOG, in the DOPAOFF condition, in both patients with PD groups (Supplementary Fig S3).\",\n    \"The analysis included data from 267 dipoles located within the STN (139 and 128 in the posterior and central STN, respectively), comprising 946 traces (725 in FOG‐NOBS and 221 in FOG‐OBS patients; see Figs 1D and 4).\",\n    \"To explore STN dysfunction linked to FOG, we compared trials with freezing (FOG‐OBS+ trials) to those without (FOG‐OBS− trials) in FOG‐OBS patients with PD (DOPAOFF condition; Fig 6).\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"判定为 both_partly。报告的核心说法，即相关分析主要来自没有实际FOG发生的步态试次，有全文依据。论文明确说明，首先进行的LFP频谱功率与步态启动参数相关性分析使用的是没有FOG的试次；图4和图5的分析也明确使用FOG-NOBS患者及FOG-OBS患者中没有发生FOG的试次。因此，不能认定报告完全误读了论文。不过，指控者指出研究确实包含实际发生FOG的试次，这一点同样正确：12名患者在99次试次中发生了FOG，共记录263次冻结事件，中位发生时间为步态启动后8步。此外，图6专门比较了发生FOG与没有发生FOG的试次，分析了实际FOG发生前的神经活动。因此，不能把整项研究或全部LFP分析概括为仅使用没有实际FOG发生的试次。关键区别在于：主要分析使用无FOG试次，但另有分析纳入了实际发生FOG的试次。报告关于主要分析数据来源的说法基本成立，指控者关于研究同时包含实际FOG事件的事实也成立；但指控者据此认定报告整体读错，论证并不充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9c59084e-5e62-4e4b-9274-00b868efc827", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T104554573556Z", "elapsed_seconds": 32.937, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T10:46:27.532578+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"